      "description": "A location where a deceased person is buried, typically marked by a tombstone or headstone. In the meme, it symbolizes death, finality, and mourning. The juxtaposition of a grave site with grilling is the core of the meme's dark humor and requires understanding of cultural norms around death and remembrance.",
